{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world as a millipede!<br><br>Millispeed is an arcade game where your primary goal is to get as long as possible. Eat pellets to grow segments and become a <strong>true millipede</strong> with 1,000 legs!  <br><br>If you get stuck, or eaten, you'll have to start over. More legs means a faster millipede. Can you control the chaos? Customize your millipede's colors and material whenever you'd like, and make it yours! <br><br>With both 'Peace' and 'Action' game modes, you get to choose the level of pressure. <br><br>In Action mode you'll need to watch out, hungry crows patrol the forest looking for a meal. Find a place to hide before your millipede becomes a bird buffet! Peace mode is a more laid back experience. Collect pellets and try to grow long without getting stuck.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818190?t=1756923602","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/b61e0700cf748cd8426ea0366176d43ee7c45e22/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756923602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/4aee3819f5adfd2429fc18ff3e22296fec7ba78c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756923602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/4aee3819f5adfd2429fc18ff3e22296fec7ba78c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756923602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world as a millipede!<br><br>Millispeed is an arcade game where your primary goal is to get as long as possible. Eat pellets to grow segments and become a <strong>true millipede</strong> with 1,000 legs!  <br><br>If you get stuck, or eaten, you'll have to start over. More legs means a faster millipede. Can you control the chaos? Customize your millipede's colors and material whenever you'd like, and make it yours! <br><br>With both 'Peace' and 'Action' game modes, you get to choose the level of pressure. <br><br>In Action mode you'll need to watch out, hungry crows patrol the forest looking for a meal. Find a place to hide before your millipede becomes a bird buffet! Peace mode is a more laid back experience. Collect pellets and try to grow long without getting stuck.</p>","developers":["Autumn Palfenier"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818190/cfebf0f4aba1716308b31c984241b9c28a6fba52/header.jpg?t=1756923602","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257167887,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167887/movie480.mp4?t=1752264924","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167887/movie_max.mp4?t=1752264924"},"name":"Millispeed Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167887/c5dfd0f611589e0621bc28dc9680da99c5ed62ed/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752264924","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167887/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752264924","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167887/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752264924"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257167653,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167653/movie480.mp4?t=1752264928","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167653/movie_max.mp4?t=1752264928"},"name":"Millispeed Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257167653/f258275ce503df577385755ae9d335bfb15550be/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752264928","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167653/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752264